8,Adyghe | TikTok,https://www.tiktok.com/discover/adyghe,Adyghe pshyne (Adyghe harmonica) is a traditional musical instrument of the Adyghe (Circassian) people. Basic information: Name: pshyne (Adyghe: Pshyne). Type of instrument: harmonica (a type of hand-held harmonica).,Adyghe,Abkhaz-Adyghe
9,Abkhaz-Adyghe etymology : Query result,https://starlingdb.org/cgi-bin/response.cgi?root=config&basename=/data/cauc/abadet&first=61&table=0,Abkhaz-Adyghe etymology : Search within this database. Total of 817 records 41 page. Meaning: 1 beetle 2 flea. Abkhaz: a-bžǝ 1. Abaza: bǝž 1. Adyghe: bžǝ-ʒa 3. Kabardian: bźǝ-ʒa 3. Comments: In Abaz. there exists also a reduplicated form bǝžbǝž.,Adyghe,Abkhaz-Adyghe
